  designNotes: 'Target friendly creature goes dark until the next Dawn: whatever
    lands this Day misses it (board-wide damage included), but its slot is empty
    meanwhile. It comes back with a new identity: Concealed for 2 Days, unknown to
    the enemy, its old statuses gone.'
